پرامپت ساختش :

A photorealistic, emotionally charged dark fantasy short film sequence featuring the woman from the reference image, shot on 35mm anamorphic lens with shallow depth of field and rich film grain. [00:00-00:05] Medium over-the-shoulder shot inside a grand, dimly lit Gothic stone cathedral with stained glass and flickering warm candles; the woman, dressed in an intricate off-shoulder white embroidered wedding gown, stands at the altar beside a blurred groom in dark red velvet, slowly turning her head back with a shocked, heartbroken expression and glistening tears. [00:05-00:10] Cut to an extreme macro close-up of a dark medieval knight standing in the church aisle, wearing weathered black gothic plate armor and a metallic crown of thorns around his helmet; through the narrow visor slit, one emotional eye wells up with a tear. [00:10-00:17] Warm golden-hour flashback in a sunlit green meadow; wide tracking shot of the woman in silver medieval armor and flowing white skirt running playfully across the grass while the dark knight chases her, dissolving into them sitting together on a grassy hill at sunset as she rests her head tenderly on his armored shoulder while wind blows through her hair and his tattered black cape. [00:17-00:24] Cut back to the shadowy cathedral center aisle; the dark knight slowly turns away and walks toward the bright open church doors, his cape billowing behind him. Audio: Melancholic solo piano and swelling emotional orchestral strings, layered with subtle church ambience, soft footsteps on stone, and gentle wind in the meadow.

